1
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
=Godslayer=
(Adapted from the novel Godslayer.)

2
00:00:33,333 --> 00:00:37,083
(Divine Era, Lunisolar Calendar,
Crescent Moon)

3
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:42,020
(Xianliang Village)

4
00:00:47,833 --> 00:00:49,042
(My sister said,)

5
00:00:49,417 --> 00:00:50,416
(when she turned fifteen,)

6
00:00:51,208 --> 00:00:52,917
(she wanted to see the lanterns
in the Capital.)

7
00:00:57,042 --> 00:00:57,917
(But they said)

8
00:00:58,542 --> 00:00:59,917
(to get from Dazedi to the Capital,)

9
00:01:00,708 --> 00:01:01,958
(you have to cross the Monster Wastes.)

10
00:01:03,375 --> 00:01:04,416
(Lu Yuanqing)
(If you run into a monster,)

11
00:01:04,708 --> 00:01:05,833
(Lu Yuanqing)
(it could cost you your life.)

12
00:01:10,792 --> 00:01:13,583
=Episode 1=
(I Defy Fate)

13
00:01:15,875 --> 00:01:16,625
Xiaoyue!

14
00:01:41,416 --> 00:01:44,041
May the gods protect us.

15
00:01:45,083 --> 00:01:45,875
Xiaoyue!

16
00:01:46,750 --> 00:01:47,375
Xiaoyue!

17
00:01:47,916 --> 00:01:48,625
Xiaoyue!

18
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:50,875
Lu!

19
00:01:51,292 --> 00:01:52,750
Your sister isn't in there.

20
00:01:54,583 --> 00:01:55,250
Lu.

21
00:01:55,916 --> 00:01:58,208
That spider monster hoards its prey

22
00:01:58,666 --> 00:02:01,666
and took your sister!

23
00:02:02,416 --> 00:02:05,250
Isn't our village protected
by Heaven's barrier?

24
00:02:06,417 --> 00:02:08,125
The gods are angry.

25
00:02:08,416 --> 00:02:10,416
That's why their protection
has weakened.

26
00:02:11,583 --> 00:02:13,916
If we don't seal this breach,

27
00:02:14,583 --> 00:02:17,416
the monsters outside will come again.

28
00:02:19,042 --> 00:02:21,541
Xianliang Village has failed
to offer enough tribute.

29
00:02:21,875 --> 00:02:24,166
We have failed to honor Heaven.

30
00:02:24,667 --> 00:02:26,041
This calamity

31
00:02:26,542 --> 00:02:28,041
is the punishment we deserve.

32
00:02:28,791 --> 00:02:32,500
May the gods forgive us.

33
00:02:32,625 --> 00:02:33,916
Gods above,

34
00:02:34,250 --> 00:02:36,000
please restore your protection!

35
00:02:36,333 --> 00:02:37,875
This year's harvest was poor.

36
00:02:37,875 --> 00:02:38,750
Next year,

37
00:02:38,750 --> 00:02:40,375
we'll offer twice as much.

38
00:02:40,375 --> 00:02:42,250
Please forgive Xianliang Village.

39
00:02:47,708 --> 00:02:48,833
Lu!

40
00:02:49,125 --> 00:02:49,708
What...

41
00:02:49,958 --> 00:02:50,958
What are you doing?

42
00:02:51,666 --> 00:02:52,333
I'm going to the monster's lair

43
00:02:53,083 --> 00:02:54,208
and bringing my sister back.

44
00:02:54,458 --> 00:02:55,583
What did you say?

45
00:02:55,708 --> 00:02:57,083
Lu, have you lost your mind?

46
00:02:57,416 --> 00:02:58,208
You can't go!

47
00:02:58,208 --> 00:02:58,666
That's right!

48
00:02:58,666 --> 00:02:59,041
Don't go!

49
00:02:59,041 --> 00:03:00,083
They're right, Lu!

50
00:03:00,083 --> 00:03:00,708
You can't go!

51
00:03:00,708 --> 00:03:01,583
Don't go!

52
00:03:01,583 --> 00:03:02,458
You believe in the gods.

53
00:03:02,750 --> 00:03:03,708
I don't.

54
00:03:06,375 --> 00:03:07,291
Lu!

55
00:03:08,208 --> 00:03:09,541
Lu!

56
00:03:10,041 --> 00:03:11,333
Blasphemy!

57
00:03:11,333 --> 00:03:13,416
Gods, please forgive him!

58
00:03:16,916 --> 00:03:18,000
Have you chosen

59
00:03:18,458 --> 00:03:19,958
a Holy Maiden?

60
00:03:40,750 --> 00:03:41,791
Xiaoyue!

61
00:03:42,250 --> 00:03:43,333
Xiaoyue!

62
00:03:55,791 --> 00:03:57,416
Across the Yuanyang Continent,

63
00:03:58,083 --> 00:03:59,791
monsters roam unchecked,

64
00:04:00,583 --> 00:04:02,000
devouring human flesh and blood.

65
00:04:02,291 --> 00:04:04,250
Their sins reach the heavens.

66
00:04:05,250 --> 00:04:07,875
By the grace of the gods,

67
00:04:08,416 --> 00:04:10,791
wherever the Eye of Heaven shines,

68
00:04:11,125 --> 00:04:13,291
no monster may enter.

69
00:04:14,167 --> 00:04:17,458
Though Xianliang Village lies
far from Heaven,

70
00:04:17,500 --> 00:04:21,458
we have never wavered in our devotion.

71
00:04:21,875 --> 00:04:24,333
On this 30th day of the twelfth month,

72
00:04:24,541 --> 00:04:26,750
we offer a maiden born
on the first day of the month,

73
00:04:27,375 --> 00:04:28,666
Lu Xiaoyue!

74
00:04:30,250 --> 00:04:31,500
Xiaoyue, where are you?

75
00:04:32,125 --> 00:04:33,625
(Aged fifteen,)

76
00:04:33,666 --> 00:04:35,250
(Lu Xiaoyue)
(pure and chaste.)

77
00:04:35,542 --> 00:04:36,791
(Lu Xiaoyue)
(She offers herself in sacrifice,)

78
00:04:36,958 --> 00:04:38,375
(willingly answering the gods' call.)

79
00:04:38,875 --> 00:04:40,250
May Heaven accept her

80
00:04:40,375 --> 00:04:43,208
and protect Xianliang Village.

81
00:04:44,791 --> 00:04:46,583
May Heaven accept her

82
00:04:47,416 --> 00:04:50,291
and protect Xianliang Village.

83
00:05:56,792 --> 00:05:58,167
(The purification is complete.)

84
00:05:58,542 --> 00:06:01,542
(Cast the divination blocks
and ask Heaven's will.)

85
00:06:18,833 --> 00:06:19,667
The divine eye!

86
00:06:24,250 --> 00:06:25,417
It opened its eye!

87
00:06:25,417 --> 00:06:27,167
The gods have accepted her!

88
00:06:27,167 --> 00:06:27,958
Thank Heaven!

89
00:06:27,958 --> 00:06:28,708
I object!

90
00:06:31,625 --> 00:06:32,000
Hurry!

91
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:32,708
Stop him!

92
00:06:40,958 --> 00:06:42,667
It wasn't a monster that took my sister.

93
00:06:42,875 --> 00:06:43,792
It was you.

94
00:06:43,916 --> 00:06:45,625
She was chosen by the gods.

95
00:06:45,625 --> 00:06:47,625
It's a blessing for your family,

96
00:06:47,625 --> 00:06:50,125
and an honor for all
of Xianliang Village.

97
00:06:53,958 --> 00:06:55,000
Be a good girl.

98
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:57,166
Yuyou Village is where the gods live.

99
00:06:57,500 --> 00:06:59,583
You'll live in bliss there.

100
00:07:00,875 --> 00:07:02,667
Be a good girl.

101
00:07:02,875 --> 00:07:04,666
I just do what's best for you.

102
00:07:16,875 --> 00:07:18,458
Xiaoyue!

103
00:07:24,708 --> 00:07:26,917
(Made in Yuyou Village)

104
00:07:39,958 --> 00:07:41,250
The barrier is restored!

105
00:07:42,791 --> 00:07:43,833
The gods have forgiven us!

106
00:07:43,833 --> 00:07:45,458
We're saved!

107
00:07:45,458 --> 00:07:46,625
We're saved!

108
00:07:46,791 --> 00:07:48,041
We're saved!

109
00:07:52,083 --> 00:07:53,250
We're saved!

110
00:07:55,125 --> 00:07:56,041
Thank Heaven!

111
00:07:56,041 --> 00:07:56,666
Xiaoyue!

112
00:07:57,291 --> 00:07:58,166
How... Why...

113
00:07:58,958 --> 00:08:00,750
Thank Heaven!

114
00:08:02,833 --> 00:08:04,166
Thank Heaven!

115
00:08:04,166 --> 00:08:04,916
Xiaoyue.

116
00:08:04,916 --> 00:08:05,666
We're saved!

117
00:08:05,666 --> 00:08:06,417
I got you the tiger-head hat

118
00:08:06,417 --> 00:08:07,750
you wanted.

119
00:08:09,542 --> 00:08:11,042
Xiaoyue, say something to me.

120
00:08:11,042 --> 00:08:12,416
Thank the gods for the protection.

121
00:08:13,041 --> 00:08:14,458
(The divine seal is set.)

122
00:08:14,541 --> 00:08:15,750
(The Holy Maiden is chosen.)

123
00:08:16,041 --> 00:08:19,041
(Hand her over to Yuyou Village's
ritual officer to open the seal.)

124
00:08:20,166 --> 00:08:20,833
You...

125
00:08:21,958 --> 00:08:24,166
Give me back my sister!

126
00:08:24,708 --> 00:08:27,583
(Only the gods can break the divine seal.)

127
00:08:28,125 --> 00:08:29,417
(This is Heaven's will.)

128
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:32,125
(You should be happy.)

129
00:08:36,333 --> 00:08:37,291
Then...

130
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:39,958
I'll smash this god statue to pieces!

131
00:08:57,542 --> 00:08:58,167
Madam Zhu.

132
00:08:58,542 --> 00:08:59,917
You saw what happened.

133
00:09:00,333 --> 00:09:02,917
Lu threatened to smash the statue.

134
00:09:03,416 --> 00:09:04,833
He must be possessed.

135
00:09:05,166 --> 00:09:07,291
If we don't purge the evil from him,

136
00:09:07,666 --> 00:09:09,833
he'll bring disaster
upon the whole village.

137
00:09:17,875 --> 00:09:19,292
Where's my sister?

138
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:21,042
Give her back!

139
00:09:21,166 --> 00:09:23,791
Your sister has already been sent
to the Capital.

140
00:09:23,916 --> 00:09:24,750
She's gone

141
00:09:24,917 --> 00:09:26,667
to atone for your sins.

142
00:09:26,791 --> 00:09:27,750
What...

143
00:09:28,583 --> 00:09:29,666
What sins have I committed?

144
00:09:29,666 --> 00:09:32,000
Disrespecting the gods is a grave sin!

145
00:09:32,708 --> 00:09:34,541
Madam Zhu has agreed to cure you.

146
00:09:34,875 --> 00:09:36,333
Once you're cured,

147
00:09:36,333 --> 00:09:37,541
you'll be just like us,

148
00:09:37,541 --> 00:09:39,500
devoted to the gods with all your heart.

149
00:09:47,625 --> 00:09:48,458
Madam Zhu,

150
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:52,541
you'd better cure that rebellious streak
of his.

151
00:09:55,208 --> 00:09:56,458
Ghost-Head Nail.

152
00:09:56,666 --> 00:09:58,041
3.3 cun.
[*11 centimeters]

153
00:09:58,750 --> 00:10:00,417
Drive one into the flesh,

154
00:10:00,750 --> 00:10:02,166
and no ghost shall cling.

155
00:10:08,917 --> 00:10:10,167
These seven nails

156
00:10:10,167 --> 00:10:12,042
run from the ghost meridian
to the heart.

157
00:10:12,667 --> 00:10:14,042
Drive them all in,

158
00:10:14,500 --> 00:10:16,416
and they will kill you.

159
00:10:16,583 --> 00:10:17,750
If you know what's good for you,

160
00:10:18,083 --> 00:10:20,083
apologize to the gods.

161
00:10:23,833 --> 00:10:25,083
I won't!

162
00:10:32,500 --> 00:10:33,166
Lu.

163
00:10:33,166 --> 00:10:34,166
Tell me.

164
00:10:34,166 --> 00:10:35,541
Were you wrong?

165
00:10:35,833 --> 00:10:38,791
Give me back my sister.

166
00:10:43,916 --> 00:10:45,666
The center of the chest
is the gate of qi.

167
00:10:45,791 --> 00:10:46,791
Seal the gate,

168
00:10:47,041 --> 00:10:48,208
and the evil power will collapse.

169
00:10:49,416 --> 00:10:51,583
Let's see how you cause trouble now.

170
00:10:54,958 --> 00:10:55,958
Lu.

171
00:10:55,958 --> 00:10:57,375
Were you wrong?

172
00:10:59,500 --> 00:11:00,333
No.

173
00:11:00,333 --> 00:11:01,125
You...

174
00:11:03,125 --> 00:11:06,583
These three nails
will break your defiance.

175
00:11:21,833 --> 00:11:22,416
Mom,

176
00:11:22,666 --> 00:11:24,333
what are they doing?

177
00:11:24,750 --> 00:11:25,666
Cover your ears,

178
00:11:25,666 --> 00:11:26,958
and you won't hear it.

179
00:11:32,250 --> 00:11:33,625
The seventh nail.

180
00:11:33,625 --> 00:11:34,916
The Spirit-Sealing Nail.

181
00:11:35,333 --> 00:11:36,625
Drive it into the spirit gate,

182
00:11:36,916 --> 00:11:38,708
and all evil shall be purged.

183
00:11:39,041 --> 00:11:39,791
Lu!

184
00:11:39,791 --> 00:11:40,875
Say it!

185
00:11:41,250 --> 00:11:42,625
Were you wrong or not?

186
00:11:43,583 --> 00:11:44,875
Just say it!

187
00:11:44,875 --> 00:11:46,000
Were you wrong?

188
00:11:51,750 --> 00:11:52,666
Wrong?

189
00:11:53,791 --> 00:11:54,708
Go

190
00:11:55,667 --> 00:11:57,041
to hell!

191
00:11:59,292 --> 00:12:01,166
He is a real plague.

192
00:12:05,875 --> 00:12:07,667
(Lu Yuanqing.)

193
00:12:09,542 --> 00:12:11,958
(Lu Yuanqing.)

194
00:12:15,500 --> 00:12:17,583
(Lu Yuanqing.)

195
00:12:24,125 --> 00:12:26,333
(We meet again.)

196
00:12:27,333 --> 00:12:28,083
Big guy,

197
00:12:28,666 --> 00:12:29,583
is that you?

198
00:12:30,250 --> 00:12:31,167
Can you

199
00:12:32,167 --> 00:12:33,375
help me one more time?

200
00:12:33,375 --> 00:12:34,291
(Yes.)

201
00:12:34,625 --> 00:12:36,500
(How can I help?)

202
00:12:37,125 --> 00:12:38,833
They took my sister.

203
00:12:39,250 --> 00:12:40,708
I'm going to the Capital

204
00:12:41,458 --> 00:12:42,708
to bring her back.

205
00:12:43,167 --> 00:12:44,333
(And then?)

206
00:12:45,166 --> 00:12:47,458
(Can you change her back?)

207
00:12:48,041 --> 00:12:49,666
(In this world,)

208
00:12:49,666 --> 00:12:51,083
(humans kneel to gods,)

209
00:12:51,083 --> 00:12:52,833
(and gods devour humans.)

210
00:12:52,833 --> 00:12:55,250
(If you want your sister back,)

211
00:12:55,250 --> 00:12:56,750
(there is only one way.)

212
00:12:56,750 --> 00:12:59,416
(A world without gods.)

213
00:12:59,750 --> 00:13:02,708
(Do you dare?)

214
00:13:04,333 --> 00:13:06,250
My sister is my only family.

215
00:13:06,833 --> 00:13:08,125
No one lays a hand on her.

216
00:13:08,958 --> 00:13:10,208
Mortals?

217
00:13:11,125 --> 00:13:12,000
I'll kill them.

218
00:13:12,708 --> 00:13:14,000
Gods?

219
00:13:14,458 --> 00:13:15,583
I'll slay them.

220
00:13:24,458 --> 00:13:26,875
(Then there is only one path.)

221
00:13:28,375 --> 00:13:29,625
(Slay the gods.)

222
00:13:29,750 --> 00:13:30,666
Slay the gods.

223
00:13:30,666 --> 00:13:31,625
(Rewrite fate.)

224
00:13:31,708 --> 00:13:32,708
Rewrite fate.

225
00:13:33,083 --> 00:13:35,208
(Replace Heaven.)

226
00:13:35,333 --> 00:13:37,458
Replace Heaven!

227
00:13:46,500 --> 00:13:48,042
(Redtail Armed Escort Agency)

228
00:13:56,560 --> 00:13:59,110
(Le Wei)

229
00:13:59,500 --> 00:14:04,110
(Wang Mansion in the Capital)

230
00:14:06,780 --> 00:14:09,230
(Wang Yan)

231
00:14:12,791 --> 00:14:13,416
Chief!

232
00:14:13,708 --> 00:14:14,375
Lu...

233
00:14:14,750 --> 00:14:15,958
He came back to life!

234
00:14:21,708 --> 00:14:23,833
(Dragon power in a mortal body)

235
00:14:24,166 --> 00:14:26,875
(is like raging fire in a clay vessel.)

236
00:14:27,416 --> 00:14:29,375
(The more you can withstand,)

237
00:14:29,458 --> 00:14:31,250
(the more power you can wield.)

238
00:14:31,625 --> 00:14:32,750
(Remember that)

239
00:14:32,958 --> 00:14:34,625
(only through countless trials
is a vessel forged,)

240
00:14:34,916 --> 00:14:37,125
(and at the brink of death,
your power grows.)

241
00:15:14,916 --> 00:15:15,791
This...

242
00:15:18,833 --> 00:15:21,708
(What will you do with them?)

243
00:15:21,708 --> 00:15:24,083
♪There are countless spring days♪

244
00:15:24,083 --> 00:15:26,333
Everyone who hurt my sister

245
00:15:26,350 --> 00:15:28,290
♪Amid the layered shadows♪

246
00:15:28,291 --> 00:15:30,958
will die.

247
00:15:31,291 --> 00:15:31,916
Lu!

248
00:15:32,083 --> 00:15:33,458
The gods claimed your sister!

249
00:15:33,458 --> 00:15:34,583
You can't stop them!

250
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:36,917
♪A hundred thousand hands♪

251
00:15:36,917 --> 00:15:37,875
♪Push me forward together♪

252
00:15:37,875 --> 00:15:39,166
He's lost his mind!

253
00:15:39,166 --> 00:15:40,125
Lu's gone mad!

254
00:15:40,125 --> 00:15:41,333
If you kill me,

255
00:15:41,958 --> 00:15:43,708
the gods will punish us!

256
00:15:44,041 --> 00:15:46,208
All of Xianliang Village
will die with me!

257
00:15:46,583 --> 00:15:47,875
Can you bear that burden?

258
00:15:48,291 --> 00:15:49,083
Then I'll

259
00:15:49,416 --> 00:15:50,750
kill you first,

260
00:15:51,583 --> 00:15:52,833
then slay the gods.

261
00:15:55,916 --> 00:15:56,750
Lu.

262
00:15:56,750 --> 00:15:58,208
You can't kill me!

263
00:15:58,541 --> 00:15:59,708
I'm the Village Chief!

264
00:16:00,375 --> 00:16:00,750
I...

265
00:16:02,125 --> 00:16:03,666
Let me go!

266
00:16:04,125 --> 00:16:05,700
♪Lift me♪

267
00:16:07,050 --> 00:16:10,300
♪Lift me into the sun♪

268
00:16:10,500 --> 00:16:11,375
♪I♪

269
00:16:12,500 --> 00:16:15,458
♪All that turns to ash is my old self♪

270
00:16:15,458 --> 00:16:16,625
(Be good, Xiaoyue.)

271
00:16:16,708 --> 00:16:17,875
(Wait at home for me.)

272
00:16:17,875 --> 00:16:20,600
♪Only in the light can I be seen♪

273
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:22,350
♪From every mouth♪

274
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:25,450
♪The crowd lifts me high♪

275
00:16:26,350 --> 00:16:28,100
♪There are countless spring days♪

276
00:16:28,100 --> 00:16:30,000
♪And countless green mountains♪

277
00:16:30,100 --> 00:16:32,708
♪Amid the layered shadows♪

278
00:16:32,708 --> 00:16:35,041
Lu's gone mad!

279
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:38,500
♪No matter how long he lasts,
he cannot outlast♪

280
00:16:38,500 --> 00:16:41,000
♪A hundred thousand hands♪

281
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:43,200
♪Push me forward together♪

282
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:46,700
♪The need for me to never look back♪

283
00:16:46,700 --> 00:16:48,500
♪Lift me♪

284
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:52,800
♪Lift me into the sun♪

285
00:16:52,900 --> 00:16:53,792
♪I♪

286
00:16:53,792 --> 00:16:58,750
♪All that turns to ash is my old self♪

